  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-56GSiVE7\">可批量查询一个账户下营销的审核建议，支持查询建议及素材审核建议</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201761864988792840%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-XbLdSdjm\" id=\"h346b9f0-XbLdSdjm\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-cJj0EX2X\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/promotion/reject_reason/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/promotion/reject_reason/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1741031528693771\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-TSa98GKP\" id=\"h346b9f0-TSa98GKP\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-xR8Xw0V7\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-AEDJ68c0\" id=\"h346b9f0-AEDJ68c0\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vqNm43uw\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VmVVTT16\" id=\"h346b9f0-VmVVTT16\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BDHEoUXP\">客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">promotion_ids</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-360k7xnl\">营销id列表，list长度1-10</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">delivery_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aolbveQB\">投放模式<code><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">已废弃</span></code>，传入无效。允许值： </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-I5M72A3V\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0mM768IU\"><code>MANUAL</code> 手动投放（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SIdKc2b2\"><code>PROCEDURAL</code> 自动投放</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">need_material_lego_mid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zr15We3D\">是否需要返回素材legoMid，默认为false</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cgAgWfgh\" id=\"h346b9f0-cgAgWfgh\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fpromotion%2Freject_reason%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20promotion_ids_list%20%3D%20PROMOTION_IDS%5Cn%20%20%20%20promotion_ids%20%3D%20json.dumps(promotion_ids_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20delivery_mode%20%3D%20DELIVERY_MODE%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22promotion_ids%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22delivery_mode%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%7D%5C%22%20%25%20(advertiser_id%2C%20promotion_ids%2C%20delivery_mode)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(get(my_args))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%22%7D%2C%7B%22language%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22import%20com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonProcessingException%3B%5Cnimport%20com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper%3B%5Cnimport%20okhttp3.*%3B%5Cnimport%20org.apache.http.client.utils.URIBuilder%3B%5Cn%5Cnimport%20java.io.IOException%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URI%3B%5Cn