 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_reject</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UViveqna\">素材维度审核建议列表</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-U5cPIOxw\">素材类型，可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-8qhqMLoL\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W1AdTdEl\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE</code> 图片</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-adXqpjHJ\"><code>CREATIVE_TITLE</code> 标题</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-S0AZAaa7\"><code>CREATIVE_CAROUSEL</code> 图文素材 <span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><sup>new</sup></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ax98OZbb\"><code>CALL_TO_ACTION</code> 行动号召</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7M2Us7eQ\"><code>CREATIVE_URL</code> 创意详情页，web_url，external_url和playable_url三种</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SYLOZHQ1\"><code>ANCHOR</code> 锚点</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-m3mvOTaM\"><code>AWEME_NICK_NAME</code> 抖音昵称</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ilh1ZNjW\"><code>CREATIVE_COMPONENT</code> 创意组件</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-l9GTMrYK\"><code>CREATIVE_VIDEO</code> 视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NcHl1CYv\"><code>OPEN_URL</code> 直达链接</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MEk2GNdE\"><code><span style=\"color: #323335;\">PRODUCT</span></code>投放产品</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2YDtrgFW\"><code>PRODUCT_DESCRIBE</code> 产品名称</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4PhtS4Ow\"><code>PRODUCT_IMAGE</code> 产品主图</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UbxYVXoh\"><code>PRODUCT_SELLING_POINTS</code> 产品卖点</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O9ZuYKML\">根据不同素材类型返回相应的值</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-6vxvEjQv\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pdTdwnmW\"><code>CREATIVE_URL</code> 创意详情页：web_url;external_url;playable_url</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XxB8UTcz\"><code>CREATIVE_TITLE</code> 标题：title</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-t0t8iqds\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE</code> 图片：image_id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WDdGR7DO\"><code>CREATIVE_VIDEO</code> 视频：video_id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AZJZhYgh\"><code>CREATIVE_CAROUSEL</code> 图文素材：返回的是图文素材内图片的image_id <span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><sup>new</sup></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Lnbu4FEt\"><code>CALL_TO_ACTION</code> 行动号召：号召文案</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BuMmJuHe\"><code>PRODUCT_IMAGE </code>产品主图：image_id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BmQvL7IK\"><code>PRODUCT_SELLING_POINTS</code> 产品卖点：产品卖点文案</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UnH7sGAL\"><code>PRODUCT_DESCRIB </code>产品名称：产品名称文案</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kaqfWeBk\"><code>CREATIVE_COMPONENT </code>创意组件：component_id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NaJM7nFi\"><code>ANCHOR </code>锚点：anchor_id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kvnpHwIm\"><code>AWEME_NICK_NAME</code> 抖音昵称：抖音昵称</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">reject_reason</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-m3vNzleM\">拒绝建议</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">suggestion</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p>